    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Owen Reilly present this spectacular south facing two-bedroom apartment, extending to approximately 75 sq. m., with a designated underground parking space and an impressive B BER rating. Ideally positioned on the top floor of the prestigious Hanover Quay development in the heart of Grand Canal Dock, this light-filled home enjoys a well-proportioned layout and an abundance of natural light throughout the day.\r\n\r\nNo. 19 Hanover Quarter offers bright and contemporary accommodation comprising a spacious living area with access to a south-facing terrace, a separate fully fitted kitchen, two generous double bedrooms, including a main bedroom with en-suite, and a family bathroom. A separate laundry room, hot press and additional storage closet complete the accommodation.\r\n\r\nResidents of Hanover Quarter also enjoy access to a beautifully maintained communal courtyard, thoughtfully designed by award-winning landscape gardener Diarmuid Gavin.\r\n\r\nThis exceptional apartment combines stylish contemporary living with an enviable location in the heart of Grand Canal Dock and must be viewed to be fully appreciated.\r\n\r\nA little more about the location...\r\n\r\nGrand Canal Dock is a vibrant urban quarter with a variety of neighbourhood bistros, cafes and restaurants clustered around the historic city dock. The iconic Bord Gáis Theatre and the Marker Hotel face onto the scenic, Martha Schwartz designed waterfront plaza. St Stephens Green, Ballsbridge, the IFSC and Sandymount are all within 20 minutes walking distance, while the DART at Grand Canal Dock provides easy access to the City Centre and beyond. the neighbourhood is home to a multitude of large multi-national employers such as Google, State Street, JP Morgan and PwC."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Hall (5.32m x 2.36m x 1.03m) Max\r\nInviting T-shaped entrance hallway with oak flooring, intercom, hot-press and storage closet.\r\n\r\nLiving/Dining Area (7.82m x 3.89m)\r\nBright living/dining area with oak flooring, floor to ceiling glazing and access to the terrace.\r\n\r\nTerrace (4.04m x 1.04m)\r\nPrivate south facing terrace, ideal for a morning coffee or al fresco dining.\r\n\r\nKitchen (3.81m x 2.11m)\r\nSeparate, fully equipped kitchen completed with granite countertops and appliances to include four ring hob, oven, dishwasher, extractor fan and fridge freezer.\r\n\r\nLaundry Room (1.03m x 0.90m)\r\nFitted with a washing machine and provides additional storage space.\r\n\r\nBedroom 1 (4.17m x 3.72m)\r\nLarge south facing double bedroom with fitted wardrobes, carpet flooring and en-suite bathroom.\r\n\r\nEn-suite (2.26m x 1.46m)\r\nFully tiled en-suite bathroom with shower cubicle, WC and wash hand basin seated on a marble plinth.\r\n\r\nBedroom 2 (4.31m x 3.71m) Max\r\nSpacious south facing double bedroom with carpet flooring and fitted wardrobes.\r\n\r\nBathroom (2.31m x 1.71m)\r\nMain bathroom with WC, wash hand basin, and bath with overhead shower. Tiled floor and partially tiled walls.\r\n\r\nStorage Closet (2.57m x 0.90m)\r\nConvenient storage closet, ideal for everyday household belongings.\r\n\r\nHot Press (1.47m x 1.00m)\r\nShelved hot press.\r\n\r\n* ALL MEASUREMENTS ARE APPROXIMATE AND FOR GUIDANCE PURPOSES ONLY *"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Top floor two-bedroom apartment.\r\nSouth facing living room, bedrooms & terrace.\r\nDesignated underground parking space.\r\nEnergy efficient B BER rating.\r\nGas fired underfloor heating.\r\nHardwood double glazed windows.\r\nAmple storage space throughout.\r\nPresented in excellent decorative condition.\r\nUpmarket development with on-site caretaker.\r\nWell-managed common areas.\r\nPrime location in the heart of Grand Canal Dock.\r\nManagement charge c. €3,508.24"
      },
      {
